### ADMIN only: create a PATIENT login linked to a patient in patient-service
### (the patientId is not checked against patient-service)
POST http://localhost:4005/auth/admin/patients
Authorization: Bearer <admin-access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.example@pms.test",
  "password": "<12-to-72-character-password>",
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
}

###
